### API Gateway Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Get All Aggregated Users (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aggregate
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get Single Aggregated User by ID (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/aggregate/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get All Posts as XML Feed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/xml
Accept: application/xml

###

### 4. Get Posts as XML Feed Filtered by User ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/xml?userId=1
Accept: application/xml
